00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:16,679
Air travels a conducting path that warms, moistens and filters it, but exchanges nothing: nostrils, nasal chambers, pharynx, larynx, trachea held open by C shaped rings of cartilage, bronchi and bronchioles.

